TI  - Competent suppliers as a missing link: A supplier-centered view on cascading private labor governance in global value chains
JO  - Journal of World Business
PY  - 2025
DO  - 10.1016/j.jwb.2024.101595
UR  - https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jwb.2024.101595
